      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The legacy of Tetsuo: The Iron Man extends beyond cyberpunk into contemporary body horror. Films like <a href=\"/movie/630240\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"630240\">Titane</a> (2021) and <a href=\"/movie/819876\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"819876\">Crimes of the Future</a> (2022) continue exploring themes of mechanical-organic fusion, while Japanese extremity cinema like <a href=\"/movie/16061\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"16061\">Tokyo Gore Police</a> (2008) builds on Tetsuo's excessive practical effects and surreal body transformations."
      }
